      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00154",
        "explanation": "The doctor addresses the family's concern about contagion directly, advises against unnecessary isolation, and normalizes household contact while maintaining basic hygiene precautions.",
        "quote": "家里正常生活即可：同桌吃饭、共用卫生间、洗衣都不影响。HBV DNA<20 IU/ml几乎不传染，肺CT也无活动结核。只需各用各的牙刷、剃须刀，有伤口及时贴创可贴，其他无需隔离。"
      }
