          "quote": "旧数字看：HBV DNA <20 IU/ml 传染性可忽略；肺结节CT已排除活动结核，暂无急迫感染风险；环孢素44 ng/ml最低有效区间，但今早吃过药今天抽血可能虚高，需要明早空腹前再抽一次真谷值。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00110",
          "explanation": "The doctor limits the scope to the current episode: wait for new results, do not self-adjust, and only rush to emergency if specific red flags appear.",
